{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中環疑發生盜竊案。今日（30日）下午2時31分，愛丁堡廣場5號香港大會堂的職員報案，稱有雕塑不知所終。警方趕至，將案件暫列「盜竊」調查。</p><p>現場可見，涉事展覽廳正舉辦「微波國際新媒體藝術節 2026」活動。翻查官方網站資料，主題展覽將於10月31至11月8日正式對外開放參觀。</p><figure><img alt=\"香港大會堂疑有展覽雕塑不翼而飛，警方到場調查。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192868574859890688728351.jpeg/aleTS2JhpooXyAwKqT4xuWsvEO6MwmLiWbGd4nyxneI\"/><figcaption>香港大會堂疑有展覽雕塑不翼而飛，警方到場調查。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"香港大會堂疑有展覽雕塑不翼而飛，警方到場調查。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192869068311760896260351.jpeg/z1ZxZMX-rPET7yHqkQsMoJKs0L6wrIykC-ikoS7opKE\"/><figcaption>香港大會堂疑有展覽雕塑不翼而飛，警方到場調查。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"香港大會堂疑有展覽雕塑不翼而飛。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192869065547583488075639.jpeg/Mn51bAm3sY41i2GCH3OdH3RjxRft65xuGiFzwD8hc8A\"/><figcaption>香港大會堂疑有展覽雕塑不翼而飛。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"香港大會堂疑有展覽雕塑不翼而飛。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192869062628216832391240.jpeg/XiIC0Kf8ynrqlxuDB4_P_fYvCGGgIlc-e4n6Ol6J-jo\"/><figcaption>香港大會堂疑有展覽雕塑不翼而飛。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"香港大會堂疑有展覽雕塑不翼而飛。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192869059826290688628134.jpeg/0JPhWYUFc4mpVmlEawZ3Zxh_qsOro-Qwp6eP2YKnj9k\"/><figcaption>香港大會堂疑有展覽雕塑不翼而飛。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:23:46.293346+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":266,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:16:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:19:26.335114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:19:26.335114+00:00","content_hash":"bcb686fcfb87f8e0efbe5d2352744b8a899c22edffb4bd5e4949fadacce6d8d6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}